  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hair, tails, so on should remain as normal, flowing in the wind as the avatar is going a constant speed. Some things however do not behave this way and arent continuously pushed by movement because they are attached to your body. In order to reduce the effect of things such a driving a car and the dynamics flying about in a very sporadic and aggressive manner, there should be a way to use momentum/acceleration instead of velocity, so that certain physbones will move when a change in velocity is detected rather than a change in position.",
